  "title": "Lower Sugar Spicy All-Day Apple Butter",
  "description": "This spiced apple butter is slow cooked with the comforting flavors of honey, maple syrup, cinnamon, cloves, and allspice. Mexican vanilla extract adds a smooth, rich taste, but you can use regular vanilla extract too.",
  "authors": [
